Z||000005||Monkeyman||12-26-1999||08:14 PM||||We can talk about spanking the monkey.  It's one of my favorite subjects! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I'm back.  I went to my father-in-laws house for the holidays.  I tried to get online the 1st night I was there, but was only slightly successful with my brother-in-laws laptop.  I got online immediately (almost) when I got home today.  I was so excited, I started to shake.  (What...you don't believe me?)  I told my wife on the way home (damn, it's a long way back here!!!) that I needed my fix.  She thought I was kidding.  THIS WILL NEVER HAPPEN AGAIN!!!!!!!!!  Next time I leave town for more than a day or so, I will rent a laptop and a cell phone.  (Is it legal to drive and use the computer at the same time!??!  Aww...who cares! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)  On a slightly more serious note, I did get to meet a couple of fellow Forum members.  That was a pleasure.  (Now I know I've gone off the deep end.  My "vacation" was a success/enjoyable/fun/? because I met forum members.  Oh, boy!  Where's my medication when I need it! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)  You guys/gals (?) are great!  To think that I'm only gone a few days and I get a thread wondering where I've gone.  (Where's the Kleenex?)||||reg||1
